WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
One round, from the parking lot to settled up.
Mike, Jess, Sarah and Tom at Tetherow. Team Nassau, skins and closest to the pin.

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:28.837
Set the round.
Course and tees, three guests and their handicaps, two teams, three games, the stakes.

3
00:00:28.837 --> 00:00:36.237
Strokes, handed out.
Full course handicaps — 9, 13, 17 and 26 — dotted on the holes where they land.

4
00:00:36.237 --> 00:00:50.607
Tap a number. Next tee.
GoLo takes each team’s better net ball. Net 3 against net 3 on the 3rd, so the skin carries.

5
00:00:50.607 --> 00:01:02.407
Front nine’s in the books.
Holes 4–9 cut for time. Jess &amp; Sarah closed out the front 3&amp;2; the back and the 18 are still live.

6
00:01:02.407 --> 00:01:14.217
The math is already done.
Holes 10–17 cut for time. Mike &amp; Tom take the back 4&amp;2 and the 18 3&amp;1.

7
00:01:14.217 --> 00:01:23.883
One number per player.
Three games netted into two payments: Sarah pays Tom $19, Jess pays Mike $11.

8
00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:28.283
GoLo keeps the tally.
The money never touches GoLo. Cash, Venmo, Zelle — your call.
